  "description": "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for OfficeAgent.NET, a translation layer between AI agents and OOXML: exposes inspect, find, preview, apply, and optional document registration and creation as MCP tools over stdio (local) or streamable HTTP (cloud). Any MCP-capable agent can read and edit Word documents and PowerPoint decks through host-configured filesystem or SharePoint connections, through a session connection the server holds in memory, or with the document passed inline as base64 - so it runs with or without storage. Preview-before-apply and optimistic concurrency throughout.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "OfficeAgent.Mcp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-09T05:58:45.837Z",
